{
  "project": "code-smells-project (authenticated)",
  "notes": [
    "Same 35 steps as the unauthenticated spec, with an admin Bearer token on every",
    "route the refactor placed behind the guard, and the registration password raised",
    "to 6 characters to satisfy the new minimum.",
    "Purpose: prove the endpoints still behave as before when properly authenticated,",
    "which the unauthenticated replay cannot show because it stops at the 401."
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "index",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/"
    },
    {
      "id": "health",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/health"
    },
    {
      "id": "produtos-list",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/produtos"
    },
    {
      "id": "produto-by-id",
